   580            // `<did>.0` off this SAME `vesselVerifyingKey` — injecting it here as the replica id keeps every
   581            // circle-verb dot this device mints disjoint from every OTHER device of the same operator by
   582            // construction, matching the dot a device's own genesis follow already carries.
   583            const circleReactors = daemonAuth.personaGroupId && daemonAuth.atom ? makeCircleReactors({
   584              resolveStore: resolveCirclesStore,
   585              tw5: ctx.tw5,
   586              replica: didFromVerifyingKey(faceAtom().key),
   587            }) : null;
   588
   589            // A FACE'S OWN NAMES ANSWER NO VERB. The private pet-name and the declared Handle ride the persona plane, and
   590            // the vessel's main thread writes them there from its custody door, only onto a plane whose rest seals (the
   591            // node package's `sealed-acts`, rows `selves.read` and `selves.carry`). A verb's outcome rests in the daemon's document in the clear and the
   592            // digest of its arguments rests in a receipt, so this island registers no verb that takes or answers a
   593            // pet-name or a declared Handle.
   594            // A FACELESS PLACE OFFERS NO FACE VERBS.
   595            //
   596            // A founding stands a PLACE first — carrying, serving the public shelf — and lights a FACE after. In
   597            // that window `faceGroup()` names nothing, so the follow verbs register only where they can act; absent
   598            // a face each answers with the act that lights one.
   599            if (circleReactors) {
