   601              // Founding writes the circles doc in the same breath as the PersonaGroup plane and its sentinel — a
   602              // PLACE bootstrap carries the daemon bag alone — and the boot refuses a partial set outright, so the
   603              // two stand or fall together. Registering the follow verbs on a faceless floor would answer a
   604              // human "circles-<tag> unresolved: the oracle registry names no such plane" — a true sentence
