   768          // The content-key holder lives in this island, so every act that needs a content key runs here. No verb
   769          // answers a key, a plaintext or a parcel: an outcome rests in the daemon wiki, so each answers addresses,
   770          // opaque ids and counts alone. A body arrives as a staged address (or inline text) and an opened body
   771          // lands in the cleartext-local tier, the same tier the wake reads. A parcel carries the key shore's
