   939    //     published glamour faces (index → nym/glamour/causal heads), so a re-publish extends the local frontier
   940    //     (persona-glamour). Distinct from the pet-name map and from the handle-book (others' nyms).
   941    // Each map changes under one custody holder (`updateCustodyRow`): a set or a clear reads the map, changes one
   942    // entry and writes it, so two acts in two processes never drop each other's entry.
